title: Moscow's displeasure
subtitle: Our standing with the Comintern has fallen.
new-page: true
tags: kpd_event
view-if: moscow_tier_pending > 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.md_tier = Q.moscow_tier_pending;
Q.moscow_tier_pending = 0;
var names = {right: 'the Right', left: 'the Left', centre: 'the Centre', apparatus: 'the Moscow apparatus', conciliators: 'the Conciliators'};
Q.md_fav_name = names[Q.moscow_favored];
Q.md_holder_name = names[Q.party_line];
if (Q.md_tier == 1) {
    // a letter
    Q.kf_apparatus_strength += 2;
} else if (Q.md_tier == 2) {
    // the subsidy is cut (post_event switches it off while trust stays under 40)
    Q.kf_apparatus_strength += 2;
    Q['kf_' + Q.party_line + '_dissent'] += 5;
} else if (Q.md_tier == 3) {
    // an open letter over the heads of the leaders
    Q['kf_' + Q.party_line + '_dissent'] += 15;
    Q.workers_kpd -= 2;
} else if (Q.md_tier >= 4) {
    // emissaries take over the districts
    Q['kf_' + Q.moscow_favored + '_strength'] += 8;
    Q['kf_' + Q.party_line + '_strength'] = Math.max(0, Q['kf_' + Q.party_line + '_strength'] - 8);
    Q['kf_' + Q.party_line + '_dissent'] += 10;
    Q.resources = Math.max(0, Q.resources - 1);
}
!}

= Moscow's displeasure

[? if md_tier = 1 : **A letter.** The Executive Committee of the International writes to the Central Committee. The tone is polite and the content is not: the line we follow is not the one the International expects, and our government options are closed until trust is above 50 again. The apparatus, which reads the letter first, gains 2 strength. ?]

[? if md_tier = 2 : **The subsidy is cut.** The Soviet subsidy is stopped, and the quarterly payment and the 5 points of readiness it gave us are gone, until trust is back above 40. The holding faction gains 5 dissent for losing the money, and the apparatus gains 2 strength. ?]

[? if md_tier = 3 : **An open letter.** The Executive Committee publishes a letter to the membership over the heads of its leaders, calling the present leadership a danger to the party. The holding faction, [+ md_holder_name +], gains 15 dissent. Workers lose faith in a party that is scolded in public (workers -2), and for as long as trust stays under 30 our campaigning is a tenth less effective. ?]

[? if md_tier >= 4 : **Emissaries.** Moscow sends its representatives to the district committees. They back [+ md_fav_name +], who gain 8 strength at the expense of [+ md_holder_name +], who lose 8 strength and gain 10 dissent. The party's treasury is audited and a resource is gone. For as long as trust stays under 15 our campaigning is a fifth less effective. ?]

The penalties lift as trust recovers. A line that Moscow favours earns a point of trust every month, and any other costs one. Reports, delegations and deeds that please the International raise it.

- @root: Continue.
